{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight Miner is a light ROGUE-like casual game. Players will play a role in the game and fight against enemies. During the game, they will obtain &quot;minerals&quot; by mining and gain certain gains to defeat the enemy. At the end of the round, you can buy props to improve the character's attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">There are many &quot;minerals&quot; buried deep underground, which will be an important means for players to win the game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">25 types of &quot;minerals&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random refresh</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control the clamp to grab &quot;minerals&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In the store, players can improve the character's attributes by purchasing props.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">38 different props</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random refresh</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gold coins purchase</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Battle content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 different styles of enemy types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level enemies are randomly generated.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648550?t=1744200296","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648550?t=1744200296","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648550/8826392acf35be842ea3bb820764ff756c4621e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744200296","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648550/8826392acf35be842ea3bb820764ff756c4621e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744200296","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight Miner is a light ROGUE-like casual game. Players will play a role 